'''Katooni '''was a [[Gender|female]] [[Tholothian]] [[Jedi]] [[Jedi Initiate|youngling]] who served the [[Jedi Order]] during the [[Clone Wars]].

During the Clone Wars, Katooni participated in [[Gathering|the Gathering]]. While on the training mission, Katooni and the other [[youngling]]s, [[Petro]], [[Zatt]], [[Ganodi]], [[Gungi]], and [[Byph]], had many adventures including a rescue mission to [[Florrum]] and a battle against [[Grievous]] and his [[Separatist Droid Army|droid army]]. After the younglings were reunited with the Republic, Ohnaka and Katooni shared a silent farewell. Ohnaka later owned a [[Katooni (ship)|ship]] that had the same name as her.

At the end of the war, Katooni was still at the Jedi Temple and was believed to have been killed when [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]] [[Operation: Knightfall|attacked]] the Temple.

==Biography==
===The Gathering===
{{Quote|But up there? It's&hellip; it's just so high. I can't do that.''"<br />"''I believe in you.''"<br />"''What if I get up there and there's nothing?''"<br />"''Well, that's a risk you'll have to take.|Katooni and Zatt|<ref name="The Gathering" />}}
[[File:IlumJediTempleInterior-TG.png|thumb|left|300px|Katooni and other younglings visiting the Ilum temple.]]
Katooni was a [[Tholothian]] [[Jedi]] [[Jedi Initiate|youngling]] during the [[Clone Wars]]. She was in [[Unidentified Clan (The Gathering)|Jedi Initiate Clan]] alongside [[Petro]], [[Gungi]], [[Ganodi]], [[Byph]], and [[Zatt]]. At some point during the war, she and her [[Clan (Jedi)|clan]] were chosen to participate in [[Gathering|the Gathering]], traveling to the [[planet]] [[Ilum]] under the supervision of [[Padawan]] [[Ahsoka Tano]] and [[astromech droid]] [[R2-D2]] to collect [[kyber crystal]]s for their own [[lightsaber]]s.<ref name="The Gathering" />

After entering the [[Jedi Temple (Ilum)|Ilum Jedi Temple]] together, the younglings were greeted by [[Grand Master]] [[Yoda]], who opened the [[Crystal Cave]] for them. Inside the cave, the younglings split up, with Katooni and Zatt choosing the same doorway to search through. Katooni saw her kyber crystal at the top of a tall cliff, and had to overcome her fears to climb the cliff and claim the crystal. On her way out of the caves, however, she was trapped when the floor collapsed beneath her. Petro, who had been having a hard time finding his crystal, saw Katooni, but initially passed her by in his rush to find his crystal before the cave froze shut again. Only when he changed his mind and turned back to help Katooni break the ice that was trapping her did he find his crystal, telling Katooni to hurry and get out of the cave. Katooni was the penultimate youngling to finish the test.<ref name="The Gathering" />

===Pirate attack and rescue===
[[File:KatooniSWE.png|thumb|Katooni holding her lightsaber]]
After returning to the ''[[Crucible]]'', the younglings were instructed on lightsaber construction by the ancient [[architect droid]] [[Huyang]]. However, the [[Ohnaka Gang]] attacked the Jedi ship, taking Tano prisoner.<ref name="Test">{{TCW|A Test of Strength}}</ref> After disobeying a direct order from [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]], the younglings launched a successful rescue mission, traveling to Ohnaka's stronghold with a [[Preigo's Traveling World of Wonder|circus group]] and freeing Ahsoka.<ref name="Bound for Rescue" /> Soon after, [[Grievous]] attacked the planet and destroyed all of the Ohnaka Gang's fleet, leaving the younglings, Huyang, and Tano stranded.<ref name="Bond">{{TCW|A Necessary Bond}}</ref>

Katooni and the others attacked the pirate stronghold, rescuing [[Hondo Ohnaka]] and his men. They then fled to the hangar, which housed Hondo's secret fleet. Hondo intended to leave Ahsoka and the others, who had engaged Grievous, though Katooni convinced him to return to rescue them.<ref name="Bond" />

Later in the war, the [[Imperial Palace|Jedi Temple]] was [[Bombing of the Jedi Temple hangar|bombed]].<ref name="Sabotage">{{TCW|Sabotage (episode)}}</ref> Katooni and her friends, doing lightsaber training with Master [[Tera Sinube]], were present when [[Anakin Skywalker]] and [[Barriss Offee]] [[Duel at the Jedi Temple|dueled]] after Skywalker discovered that Offee had masterminded the bombing and framed Tano for the crime.<ref name="The Wrong Jedi">{{TCW|The Wrong Jedi}}</ref>

===Yoda's vision===
{{Quote|Master Yoda. Let me take you away from your confusion, your anger, your sadness! Come with me and you will never know pain. Never know sadness. Close your eyes, and I will guide you.|The illusion of Katooni, to Yoda|<ref name="Destiny">{{TCW|Destiny (The Clone Wars)}}</ref>}}
In the [[19 BBY|final year]] of the Clone Wars, Yoda traveled to the [[Wellspring of Life]] in order to learn how to become a [[Force spirit|Force ghost]], where the [[Force Priestesses]] tested him with a journey through the [[Valley of Extinction]]. Inside, after encountering an illusion of the Jedi Temple attacked, with dead bodies including those of Petro, Zatt, and Ganodi as well as a dying Tano, Yoda encountered an illusory Katooni who invited him into a version of the Jedi Temple where the war had never happened. The illusory youngling asked Yoda if the Temple was not beautiful. However, Yoda realized it was an illusion and rejected it.<ref name="Destiny" />

===End of the war===
At the end of the war, Katooni was still at the Jedi Temple.<ref name="Helmet Collection 31">{{HelmetCollectionCite|31|Databank A-Z}}</ref> When Skywalker, now the [[Sith Lord]] [[Darth]] Vader,<ref name="Episode III">{{Film|III}}</ref> [[Operation: Knightfall|attacked]] the Temple, Katooni was believed to have been killed alongside many others during the attack.<ref name="Helmet Collection 31" />

===Legacy===
Long after the Clone Wars, the [[Great Jedi Purge]], and the [[Proclamation of the New Order|rise]] and [[Galactic Civil War|fall]] of the [[Galactic Empire]], Hondo Ohnaka, by that time living in [[Black Spire Outpost]] on [[Batuu]], owned a modified [[starship]] named [[Katooni (ship)|''Katooni'']].<ref name="Databank Katooni ship">{{Databank|katooni-ship|''Katooni'' (Ship)}}</ref>

==Personality and traits==
{{Quote|What about the others? We can't just leave them.''"<br />"''You are welcome to come, small one. You may join our merry band of pirates.''"<br />"''I won't just run away. Ahsoka trusted you. We all trusted you.|Katooni and Hondo Ohnaka|<ref name="Bond" />}}
[[File:Katooni-TCWs5BR1.png|thumb|right|180px|Katooni at the time of the Gathering]]
Katooni was a [[Gender|female]] Tholothian, with [[Color|blue]] [[eye]]s and dark brown skin with purple patches on her face. Her head was crowned with the bony crest and scaled scalp characteristics of her [[species]], with six pale, fleshy tendrils hanging down from it.<ref name="The Gathering" /> She was 1.3 [[meter]]s, or 4 [[Foot|feet]], 3 inches tall.<ref name="Join the Battle" /> 

She was very patient, as shown when she waited to complete her lightsaber.<ref name="The Gathering" /> She was trusting, believing in Hondo Ohnaka when he told her he would help rescue Ahsoka Tano.<ref name="Bond" /> She appeared to have a fear of heights, as she was reluctant to climb the cliff in the Crystal Cave on Ilum. While very kind, Katooni was not afraid to call out Petro on numerous occasions.

Katooni was cautious by nature. The Crystal Cave of Ilum presented her with a test where she had to overcome her fears by climbing a tall cliff to claim her kyber crystal,<ref name="The Gathering" /> and when she and her friends wound up in danger, she attempted to be the voice of reason. She also occasionally doubted herself and her abilities, which led her to take longer to finish constructing [[Katooni's lightsaber|her lightsaber]] than her friends. However, when the younglings were forced to team up with Hondo Ohnaka and his pirates, she ended up forming a strange friendship with the pirate [[captain]], persuading him to help Tano and the others instead of abandoning them to General Grievous.<ref name="Bond" /> Katooni looked up to Tano, even drawing posters of the Jedi.<ref name="Almost a Jedi" />

==Powers and abilities==
Katooni, as one of the top of her class, had reasonably advanced [[The Force|Force]] skills for her age. She was able to telekinetically break a thick sheet of ice while working with Petro,<ref name="The Gathering" /> and was skilled enough at Force-assisted acrobatics to successfully pose as a circus performer.<ref name="Bond" /> Katooni also held her own defending herself with her lightsaber during combat against battle droids<ref name="Bound for Rescue" /> and pirates.<ref name="Bond" /> She was also a strong and natural leader, trusting in her growing skills and her sense in the Force to lead the other members of her clan.<ref name="Join the Battle" />

==Equipment==
[[File:Katooni-SWE.png|thumb|250px|right|Katooni wielded a blue-bladed lightsaber]]
Katooni wore brown and tan [[Jedi apparel|Jedi robes]], and a traditional Tholothian headdress made of brown material lined with gold around her head.<ref name="The Gathering" /> She wielded a blue-bladed lightsaber.<ref name="Bond" />

==Behind the scenes==
Katooni was created and developed for the ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]'' animated television series. She was voiced by [[Olivia Hack]].<ref name="The Gathering" />

